<h3 class="enhancer-section">Selected contributions</h3>

<p>We are very grateful for all the participants who submitted their contribution pitches. A lot of good submissions were received, and we're trying to accommodate as many as possible this year, eliminating the usual repetition of the talks.</p>

<p>The organizing committee has selected the following contributions for the Symposium:</p>

<h4>Workshops</h4>

