{# <p>Would you like to help shape the EnhanceR Symposium? We are looking for contributions from a range of areas relevant to our community:</p>

<ul>
  <li><b>Show-and-tell sessions:</b> Share software you developed, a specific project, tool or technique. These are 20 minute sessions, plus 10 minutes for set-up and discussions.</li>
  <li><b>Workshops:</b> Lead a more in-depth, hands-on session or facilitate a discussion on a topic, 45 minute sessions.</li>
</ul>

<p>Examples for workshops include, but are not limited to:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Hands-on sessions focusing on specific techniques (e.g., advanced Git workflows).</li>
  <li>Effective data management strategies and techniques.</li>
  <li>Generative AI in RSE: practical applications and implications.</li>
  <li>Implementing best practices for reproducible, ethical, inclusive, and collaborative data science and research, following principles like those championed by "The Turing Way".</li>
  <li>Strategies for scaling up RSE initiatives within Switzerland.</li>
  <li>Project management methodologies tailored for research software projects.</li>
  <li>Navigating the role and challenges of an RSE.</li>
</ul>

<p>Idea submission deadline has been extended to <b>July 11th, 2025</b>.</p>

<p>Please submit your idea as part of your <a href="https://forms.enhancer.ch/forms/symposium-2025-registration">registration</a>.</p> #}
